          "1. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from his father from ibn abu ‘Umayr from certain persons of his people from ibn Bukayr from Zurarah who has said the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘It is not a divorce unless it is intended to be a divorce.’” "
